      "stem": "At 4:48 p.m., what does Elena imply when she writes, \"My economics class starts at noon\"?",
      "rawDisplayText": "29. At 4:48 p.m., what does Elena imply when she writes, \"My economics class starts at noon\"?",
      "payload": {
